7580	7736	Commissioners-designate
The responsible committee held a 3-hour hearing of the Commissioner-designate to examine the candidate's competence and suitability.
7737	7868	Committee decided if candidate is suitable to become a European Commissioner and if their knowledge of the portfolio is sufficient.
7869	7926	After each hearing, the committee voted on the candidate.
