8140	8314	If such support was not reached, then committee as a whole took a vote on a Commissioner-designate, where a candidate needed the support of the majority of committee members.
8315	8479	If candidate was rejected by the committee as well, President-elect could propose a new candidate, in which case a new hearing would take place for a new candidate.
8480	8588	Coordinators could also decide to hold additional hearing of 1.5 hours or demand additional written answers.
8589	8688	If there were more committees hearing one candidate, all committees would give a joint evaluation.

